- Equitable promotion rates: We compare the promotion rate of women to the next grade with their representation at the beginning of the year, at each grade and in every country;

- Pyramid rebalancing: We track improvements in women’s representation across all grades, aiming to reduce the typical drop-off from early career to managerial levels;

