Yes. All our campuses conform to ISO 45001:2018 (Occupational Health & Safety management system) with 100% operational coverage and are certified by accredited third party agencies. Besides internal and thirdparty audits, EHS experts periodically assess every unit (at least once in six months), to ensure compliance to statutory norms and requirements. We also have a dedicated "Health and Safety Policy" in place.

- **b. What are the processes used to identify work-related hazards and assess risks on a routine and non-routine basis by the entity?**

